595
00:34:33,179 --> 00:34:35,870
So that's going to
be my full Gaussian

596
00:34:35,870 --> 00:34:47,690
here, 2 pi sigma squared e to
the negative xn plus 1 minus 1

597
00:34:47,690 --> 00:34:56,000
minus alpha xn, that whole
